## Secrets / local. The patterns are intentionally broad so a
## contributor who drops a credential file at the repo root with a
## "normal" name (dropbox.env, aws.pem, .env, ...) can't accidentally
## commit it before noticing.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/secrets.*
.env
*.env
*.pfx
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
*.token
*.credentials.json
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*

## E2E scenario test secrets — dropbox tokens, OAuth bits.
## Single dotenv-style file beside the test .csproj.
tests/Backspace.Tests/secrets.env

## E2E scenario artifacts (regenerated on every run).
tests/Backspace.Tests/artifacts/scenarios/

