## Local-only design notes (kept on disk for reference, never committed)
## Context.txt + BACKSPACE_PORT_DESIGN.md + backup-engine-comparison.html
## are the original port-from-Duplicacy planning docs. AGENT.md is the
## single source of truth for the current codebase; do not resurrect
## CLAUDE.md (a prior transient handoff that's been folded into AGENT.md).
BACKSPACE_PORT_DESIGN.md
Context.txt
backup-engine-comparison.html
CLAUDE.md

# xUnit / trx test logger output — per-run noise.
tests/**/TestResults/

# .claude/ holds session-local helpers and watchdog state. The
# script itself is committed (so multiple devs can re-use it) but
# the per-run heartbeat + log are local noise.
.claude/continue-watchdog.heartbeat.txt
.claude/continue-watchdog.log

# RELEASE_READINESS.md is a per-session autonomous-run summary,
# not part of the public repo.
RELEASE_READINESS.md

# Upstream PR forks (Backrest, restic) — local clones for build/test work
.upstream-prs/

# Exact-commit release attestations are transferred to CI, not committed.
/release-checks/
